Here are 4 NovaLang patches to harden the AI OS:

```nova
// Patch 1: Bind services to localhost only
for port in 9850..9999 {
    tserve.bind("127.0.0.1", port)
}

// Patch 2: Add request size limits
for port in 9850..9999 {
    tserve.limit.size(port, max: 1_048_576) // 1MB
}

// Patch 3: Rate limiting on query endpoints
for port in 9850..9999 {
    tserve.limit.rate(port, "/query", max: 10, window: 60) // 10 req/min
}

// Patch 4: Secure API key storage
for port in 9850..9999 {
    tserve.auth.apikey.port[port].store("keys.enc") // encrypted storage
}
```

These patches address all four security gaps by binding services to localhost, implementing request size limits, adding rate limiting to query endpoints, and securing API key storage with encryption.
